one, and y equals two.

61
00:05:04,033 --> 00:05:08,876
Back-substitute: one plus two plus z
equals six, so z equals three.

62
00:05:09,326 --> 00:05:14,572
The solution is the ordered triple one
comma two comma three. Check it in all

63
00:05:14,572 --> 00:05:15,662
three equations.

64
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:23,728
Your turn. Solve x plus y plus z equals
four, x minus y equals one, and z equals

65
00:05:23,728 --> 00:05:24,074
