73
00:05:51,592 --> 00:05:53,576
Each fact becomes one equation.

74
00:05:54,699 --> 00:05:59,720
A concert sold two hundred tickets for a
total of four thousand two hundred

75
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:04,607
dollars. Floor tickets cost thirty
dollars, balcony twenty, and lawn ten.

76
00:06:04,607 --> 00:06:08,289
There were twice as many lawn tickets as
floor tickets.

77
00:06:08,739 --> 00:06:14,954
So f plus b plus l equals two hundred,
thirty f plus twenty b plus ten l equals

78
00:06:14,954 --> 00:06:18,573
four thousand two hundred, and l equals
two f.

79
00:06:19,699 --> 00:06:23,539
Substitute l equals two f into the other
two equations.

80
00:06:23,989 --> 00:06:30,133
Three f plus b equals two hundred, and
fifty f plus twenty b equals four thousand

81
00:06:30,133 --> 00:06:35,974
two hundred. Solving gives f equals
twenty, b equals one hundred forty, and l

82
00:06:35,974 --> 00:06:36,960
